<!-- G11a-2 fixture, written by hand for the parity harness of PPP (no source music): two parts: a cue line on a single staff over a piano on a grand staff. The player plays the piano; the cue part is read, not played (hand "x" in the old Score), so the hand filter and the follow gates must leave it out in every hand mode. Bars 2-3 are repeated; a tie runs from bar 3 to bar 4 in the right hand. Written order: 1 2 3 | 2 3 4 5. -->
